Apna Bana Le Guitar Chords easy lesson with strumming pattern, sung by Arijit Singh from Bollywood Hindi movie Bhediya.

Strumming Pattern: DDDD DDDD

Chords Used: D, G, Em, C, Am, Bm

Tu mera koyi [D]na hoke bhi kuch [G] laage,        Tu mera koyi [D]na hoke bhi kuch [G] laage
Kiya re jo bhi [Em]toone kaise [D] kiya re,        Jiya ko mere [C] baandh aise [Bm]liya re

Samajh ke bhi [Am]na samajh main sa [Bm]kun,        Saveron ka [Am]mere tu suraj [Em]laage

Tu mera koyi [Am]na hoke bhi kuch [C]laage,        Tu mera koyi na [Am]hoke bhi kuch [Em]laage
Tu mera koyi [Am] na hoke bhi kuch [C] laage [G]…

[C]Apna bana le piya,        [Em]Apna bana le piya
